                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>No record of the substance of this meeting has been found. Churchill had his quarters in H. M. S. <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Orion</hi> in Grand Harbor, Malta. The information given
                    here as to the meeting and the participants is taken from Churchill, <ref target="#pg343">p.
                    343</ref>.</p>
            </div>
